caption: 🐛 Native Life
setting-component: native-life

Mostly eradicated during terraforming, but some regrowth observed:

Shiverreeds: Grasslike hybrid plant, toxic to livestock but used in biofuel synthesis

Glass Ticks: Crystalline arthropods that infest solar panels; require microwave cleansing

Controlled ecological zones have been established in protected nature cores—largely for biotech study and Elgari propaganda showcasing “balanced planetary stewardship”
